      "_ventValve": "UNVERIFIED - leave null until the wiring is confirmed. Two things are unresolved: whether the board's BB vent solenoid is this GN2 vent at all (hardware.json marks DC3/DC4 as pushbutton channels PB1/PB3, while the BB press valves are solenoids S1/S2), and whether the heartbeat's vent01 bit reports COIL state or FLOW state. These vents are normally-open, so the two readings are opposites: setting this now makes the board's 'not venting' reopen a vent the operator just closed."
    }
